  "keyFeatures": [
    "JWT-based authentication with access and refresh tokens, role-based access control",
    "Full inventory management: products, categories, stock tracking, barcode support",
    "Sales processing with multi-payment methods (EFECTIVO, QR, TRANSFERENCIA) and stock auto-deduction",
    "Cash register session management: open/close shifts, cash movements, balance reconciliation",
    "Agent/operator financial transactions (deposits, withdrawals, QR transfers via Tigo Money, BCP, etc.)",
    "Mobile top-up (recargas) management with operator balance injection",
    "Purchase/procurement tracking with optional automatic cash register deduction",
    "WhatsApp messaging via Baileys: text, images, documents, and group messages",
    "Email notifications via Nodemailer/Resend with Handlebars templates",
    "Reports and dashboard statistics: sales, inventory, operator productivity, cash movements",
    "Redis caching for high-performance data access",
    "WebSocket gateway via Socket.IO for real-time events",
    "Swagger/OpenAPI interactive documentation at /api"
  ],
